6	 * Flow: the alarm set changes -> build a VGADV1 request -> queue one agent
7	 * round -> when the round ends, read what the agent wrote and put it through
8	 * vg_ai_advice_parse().  Only a document that parses is ever published to the
9	 * page, which is what lets the page show AI text without owning a
10	 * fallback path of its own: a miss simply means the deterministic rule
11	 * summary stays on screen.
12	 ****************************************************************************/
